hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"20960","Affan narrated to us, Yazid ibn Zuray narrated to us, Khalid al-Hadhdha narrated to us from Abu Uthman from Mujashi ibn Masud who said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, this is Mujalid ibn Masud pledging to you for emigration. He said: No emigration after the conquest of Makkah, but I pledge him for Islam."
